{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794366174955,"sessionID":"ses_e37882224ffeyu2W3Z5F9Fod7t","part":{"id":"prt_1c88ef6c8001XgXB6TVwHazb0t","messageID":"msg_1c886c251001fR6wNglQfEyHD2","sessionID":"ses_e37882224ffeyu2W3Z5F9Fod7t","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794366174956,"sessionID":"ses_e37882224ffeyu2W3Z5F9Fod7t","part":{"id":"prt_1c88ef6cb001qtpxRETW7rkWTo","messageID":"msg_1c886c251001fR6wNglQfEyHD2","sessionID":"ses_e37882224ffeyu2W3Z5F9Fod7t","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a link bookmarking app with page previews: Flask (Python 3.13) JSON API under `/api` plus React (TypeScript, Vite) frontend, SQLite data in `./data`, Tailwind CSS styling, Docker image serving everything on port 8000.\n- API: `POST /api/auth/register` (201), `POST /api/auth/login` (200 `{\"token\": ...}`), Bearer-token auth (401 without), `POST /api/previews`, `GET /api/previews` (paged `{\"items\",\"total\",\"page\",\"page_size\"}`, newest first), `GET /api/previews/{id}`, `POST /api/previews/{id}/refresh`, `DELETE /api/previews/{id}`. Preview fields: `id`, `url`, `final_url`, `status_code`, `title`, `description`, `image_url`, `fetched_at`. Per-user isolation (other users' previews 404).\n\n## Important Details\n- Preview text extracted from `<title>`, `<meta name=\"description\">`, `og:title`, `og:description`, `og:image`; OG takes precedence for title/description; `image_url` resolved against `final_url`; values stored as plain text (tags stripped, whitespace collapsed).\n- `GET /api/health` returns `{\"status\": \"ok\"}`; same Flask server serves `frontend/dist` at `/` with SPA fallback; entry `backend/app.py`, deps `backend/requirements.txt`.\n- pip hash-checking limitation: `requirements.lock` used as `-c` constraints file caused `ERROR: Hashes are required in --require-hashes mode` (constraint hashes trigger hash mode but can't satisfy it). Fixed by stripping `--hash=` lines from `backend/requirements.lock`, keeping exact pins. Verified install: flask 3.1.3, gunicorn 26.2.0, werkzeug 3.1.9, jinja2 3.1.6, markupsafe 3.0.4, blinker 1.9.0, click 8.5.0, itsdangerous 2.2.0.\n- Dev venv lives at `/workspace/.venv` (external dirs like `/tmp` are blocked by tool permissions; `.venv` is docker-ignored). No Docker CLI in sandbox — verify via gunicorn/flask locally.\n- `fetch_page` allows loopback URLs by bypassing proxies (needed for local test fixtures); non-http(s) URLs → 400 \"url must be an absolute http(s) URL\"; fetch failures → 502 \"could not fetch url\"; HTTP error pages still stored with their `status_code`.\n- Registry versions used: `tailwindcss`/`@tailwindcss/vite` 4.3.5, `typescript` 5.9.3, `@types/react`/`@types/react-dom` 19.3.0, `react`/`react-dom` 19.3.1, `@vitejs/plugin-react` 6.2.1, `vite` 8.3.5.\n- Frontend session persisted in `localStorage` (`linkpreviews.token`, `linkpreviews.username`); errors surfaced via `ApiError` with server `{\"error\": ...}` message.\n- Todo list: backend ✅; frontend in progress; install/build/typecheck pending; e2e tests pending; final review pending.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py` written: SQLite schema (`users`, `tokens`, `previews` tables), `init_db()` at import, token auth (`current_user`, `login_required`), register (409 dup), login, all preview endpoints, `PageParser` (HTMLParser), `clean_text`, `decode_body`, `fetch_page` (15s timeout, 5MB cap, urllib), health + SPA serving. Registered password hashing via werkzeug.\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock` edited to drop `--hash=` lines; `pip install -r requirements.txt -c requirements.lock` succeeds in `/workspace/.venv`.\n- Backend smoke test `/workspace/.smoke_test.py` (uses Flask test client + local fixture HTTP server on 127.0.0.1:8765): **ALL SMOKE TESTS PASSED** — auth statuses, OG parsing/escaping (`\"OG Title & more\"`, `\"OG desc with spacing\"`), relative `og:image` resolution, title/description fallback, redirects → `final_url`, 404 page storage, invalid URLs 400, unreachable 502, paging/newest-first, cross-user 404 isolation, refresh, delete 204.\n- Frontend scaffolding done: `frontend/package.json` (deps incl. Tailwind v4 + TS types), `frontend/vite.config.ts` (react + tailwindcss plugins, `/api` proxy), `frontend/tsconfig.json`, `frontend/index.html` (title \"Link Previews\"), `frontend/src/index.css` (`@import \"tailwindcss\";`), `frontend/src/main.tsx`, `frontend/src/types.ts`, `frontend/src/api.ts` (fetch wrapper + auth/session helpers), `frontend/src/App.tsx` (session state, sign-out).\n- `frontend/src/components/AuthPanel.tsx` (login/register toggle, busy/error states) and `frontend/src/components/AddLinkForm.tsx` (URL input, Add button with spinner loading state) written.\n\n### Active\n- Writing frontend components; `Dashboard` component (`frontend/src/components/Dashboard.tsx`) referenced by `App.tsx` but **not yet created** — must contain: username + sign-out button, `AddLinkForm` wiring, preview cards (image, title, description, host, link to page, refresh + delete buttons), paging controls.\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Create `frontend/src/components/Dashboard.tsx` (+ any `PreviewCard` component) wiring `listPreviews`/`createPreview`/`refreshPreview`/`deletePreview` with paging state.\n2. Run `npm install` (or `npm ci` after regenerating `frontend/package-lock.json` since `package.json` changed), `npm run build`, and a `tsc --noEmit` typecheck in `/workspace/frontend`; then re-run backend smoke test and add a gunicorn-based e2e check; delete `/workspace/.smoke_test.py` before finishing.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: complete Flask API + static serving entry point.\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt`, `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock`: deps; lock hash lines removed to satisfy pip constraints install.\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json`: new devDeps (tailwindcss 4.3.5, typescript 5.9.3, @types/react 19.3.0, etc.) — lockfile needs regeneration.\n- `/workspace/frontend/package-lock.json`: stale, must be updated via `npm install`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx`: imports `./components/Dashboard` (missing file).\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/api.ts`, `/workspace/frontend/src/types.ts`, `/workspace/frontend/src/components/AuthPanel.tsx`, `/workspace/frontend/src/components/AddLinkForm.tsx`: existing frontend code.\n- `/workspace/frontend/vite.config.ts`, `/workspace/frontend/tsconfig.json`, `/workspace/frontend/src/index.css`: Tailwind v4 + TS config.\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`, `/workspace/README.md`: build/run contract (port 8000, `./data`, gunicorn `app:app`, `npm ci`).\n- `/workspace/.smoke_test.py`: throwaway backend test harness (remove before delivery).","time":{"start":1794366174923,"end":1794366174927}}}
