{"type":"text","timestamp":1794366226374,"sessionID":"ses_e37882224ffeyu2W3Z5F9Fod7t","part":{"id":"prt_1c88fbfa8001iVf216qwrkErbd","messageID":"msg_1c88f96ad0017s4Wx4pjslFIOA","sessionID":"ses_e37882224ffeyu2W3Z5F9Fod7t","type":"text","text":"Done. Summary of the full build:\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`, 484 lines) — Flask JSON API: register/login with hashed passwords + bearer tokens, all preview endpoints (create/list/get/refresh/delete) with per-user isolation (cross-user → 404), page fetching with redirect tracking, `og:`/`<title>`/`<meta>` extraction to plain text, paged newest-first lists, `/api/health`, SPA serving of `frontend/dist`. Data in SQLite under `./data`.\n\n**Frontend** (`frontend/` — React 19 + TS + Vite + Tailwind v4) — `AuthPanel` (login/register), `Dashboard` (username + sign-out, add-link form with loading state, preview cards with image/title/description/host + refresh/delete, `Pager`), session persisted in localStorage, expired-token handling.\n\n**Fixes along the way** — `requirements.lock` hashes broke pip's constraints mode (`--require-hashes` triggered but unsatisfiable); stripped hash lines, exact pins kept. Tailwind v4 was scanning a stale `dist/`, fixed with `frontend/.gitignore`.\n\n**Verification** — smoke suite (parser edge cases: entities, uppercase tags, OG precedence, charset, redirects, HTTP-error pages) + e2e over real gunicorn on :8000 (exact Docker CMD): 35 checks including auth, paging, cross-user 404s, static/SPA serving, and data persistence across a restart. `tsc --noEmit` clean, `npm ci` reproducible, build stable. All throwaway test scripts and test data removed — working tree contains only the deliverable.","time":{"start":1794366226345,"end":1794366226347}}}
